OL,4,BWarwickshire legend Bell named Phoenix 
OL,5,Bhead coach                             
OL,6,GWarwickshire legend Ian Bell will      
OL,7,Greturn to Edgbaston next summer after  
OL,8,Gbeing named as the new head coach of   
OL,9,Gthe Birmingham Phoenix men's team.     
OL,11,FFormer England star Bell, who spent    
OL,12,Fhis whole county career with           
OL,13,FWarwickshire, will succeed New         
OL,14,FZealander Shane Bond, who was sacked   
OL,15,Fin October after the Phoenix won just  
OL,16,Fonce last summer and finished bottom   
OL,17,Fof their group.                        
